    "sub_name": "互連網路",
    "sub_ename": "INTERCONNECTED NETWORKS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程主要介紹小型網路中路由器和交換器的結構、元件和基本運作原理及IPv6 相關技術。",
    "describe_eh": "This course introduces the architecture, components, and operations of routers and switches in a small network; the course also introduces the technologies of IPv6.",
    "pre_subname": "IECS2004通訊與網路概論",
    "pre_sub_id3": "IECS2004",
    "pre_sub_ename": "IECS2004 INTRODUCTION TO NETWORK COMMUNICATION",
